        "b0": "Auto Open is a convenience feature. It depends on your phone's Bluetooth, its battery and power-saving settings and its operating system's background rules, which are outside our control. It may fail to open, open later than expected, or open when you are near the gate without intending to pass. You can turn Auto Open off at any time."
