        "title": "11. Fees",
        "b0": "The app and the features described in these Terms are currently provided without a subscription fee. Controllers and installation are sold separately under the quote, invoice or agreement of the seller or installer, which governs price, delivery and hardware warranty. If we introduce paid features in the future, we will present their price and terms before you choose to buy them."
